# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# LinguaVerse — Environment Variables (NAMUNA)
#
# BU FAYLGA HAQIQIY KALIT YOZMANG — u GitHub'da ochiq turadi.
#
# Mahalliy sinov uchun:  .env  fayliga yozing (.gitignore da)
# Netlify uchun:  Site configuration → Environment variables
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── AI (netlify/functions/ai.js) ────────────────────────────────────
# DIQQAT: bu kalitlarni admin panel orqali ham saqlash mumkin
# (admin.html → "API Kalitlar"). O'shanda data/api-keys.json ga yoziladi.
#
# Groq — bepul, https://console.groq.com/keys
# Speaking (nutqni matnga) uchun ham ishlatiladi.
GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_sizning_kalitingiz

# Gemini — https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# Bir nechta kalitni VERGUL bilan yozing: tizim navbat bilan ishlatadi,
# bittasining kunlik kvotasi tugasa keyingisiga o'tadi.
GEMINI_API_KEYS=AIza_kalit_1,AIza_kalit_2,AIza_kalit_3

# DeepSeek — https://platform.deepseek.com/api_keys
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=sk_sizning_kalitingiz

# OpenRouter — https://openrouter.ai/keys
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-sizning_kalitingiz

# Cloudflare Workers AI — https://dash.cloudflare.com/profile/api-tokens
# Token "Workers AI" (AI:Run) huquqiga ega bo'lishi kerak.
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=cloudflare_tokeni
CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=cloudflare_account_id

# Azure OpenAI (AI router uchun) — Azure Portal → Azure OpenAI
AZURE_OPENAI_KEY=azure_openai_kaliti
AZURE_OPENAI_RESOURCE=resurs_nomi
AZURE_OPENAI_DEPLOYMENT=gpt-4o

# ── SPEAKING (netlify/functions/azure-speech.js) ────────────────────
# Azure Portal → Speech Service → Keys and Endpoint
# 13 tilda neural ovoz + talaffuz bahosi (o'zbekcha Madina/Sardor).
AZURE_SPEECH_KEY=azure_speech_kaliti
AZURE_SPEECH_REGION=eastus

# ── ELEVENLABS — AI ustoz ovozi (emotsiya bilan) ────────────────────
# https://elevenlabs.io/app/settings/api-keys  (admin panel → API Kalitlar orqali ham)
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=sk_elevenlabs_kaliti
# Bo'sh = eleven_multilingual_v2 (barqaror). eleven_v3 — eng kuchli emotsiya
# ([angry], [laughs], [sighs] teglari bilan). Tavsiya: avval v2, keyin v3 ni sinang.
ELEVENLABS_MODEL=
# Har bir til ustozining ovozi (ixtiyoriy — bo'sh bo'lsa standart ovoz):
# ELEVENLABS_VOICE_EN=  ELEVENLABS_VOICE_RU=  ELEVENLABS_VOICE_ES=  ELEVENLABS_VOICE_DE=
# ELEVENLABS_VOICE_TR=  ELEVENLABS_VOICE_AR=  ELEVENLABS_VOICE_KO=  ELEVENLABS_VOICE_ZH=

# ── IELTS IMTIHONCHI (netlify/functions/teacher.js) ─────────────────
# Netlify'da funksiya taymautini 26 soniyaga oshirgan bo'lsangiz (Site
# configuration → Functions), shu qiymatni yozing — baholashda eng kuchli
# fikrlovchi modellar (Gemini 2.5 Pro, DeepSeek R1) ishlatiladi.
# Yozilmasa: 10 soniyalik standart chegara uchun tez-kuchli modellar.
# FUNCTION_TIMEOUT_MS=26000

# ── TO'LOV (netlify/functions/payment.js) ───────────────────────────
# inpay.uz merchant kabinetidan olinadi.
# INPAY_SANDBOX=1 bo'lsa haqiqiy pul o'tmaydi — oqimni sinash uchun.
# API auth (bearer) va webhook imzo secreti IKKI ALOHIDA kalit.
INPAY_SANDBOX=1
INPAY_API_URL=https://inpay.uz
INPAY_MERCHANT_ID=merchant_id
INPAY_BEARER_TOKEN=kassa_bearer_tokeni
INPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=webhook_imzo_secreti
# INPAY_SECRET_KEY=eski_bitta_kalit    # ikkalasi o'rniga ishlatiladi (eski loyihalar)

# ── SUPABASE (asosiy baza va kirish tizimi) ──────────────────────────
# Supabase → Project Settings → API. service_role kaliti butun bazaga to'liq
# huquq beradi — faqat Netlify env'da saqlang, brauzerga HECH QACHON bermang.
SUPABASE_URL=https://gdifhnsffhscuetpyqwx.supabase.co
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=service_role_kaliti
# Bir martalik ko'chirish sahifasi (/admin/migrate.html) uchun maxfiy so'z (12+ belgi)
MIGRATION_SECRET=uzun_tasodifiy_maxfiy_soz

# ── FIREBASE ADMIN (endi faqat ESKI hisoblarni ko'chirish uchun) ─────
# Ko'chirish tugagandan va hamma eski foydalanuvchilar bir marta kirib
# o'tgandan keyin (taxminan 1–3 oy) bularni o'chirsa bo'ladi.
# Firebase Console → Project settings → Service accounts
#   → "Generate new private key" → yuklangan JSON ichidan.
# DIQQAT: private key butun bazaga to'liq huquq beradi.
FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=linguaverse-81b52
FIREBASE_CLIENT_EMAIL=firebase-adminsdk-xxxxx@linguaverse-81b52.iam.gserviceaccount.com
FIREBASE_PRIVATE_KEY="-----BEGIN PRIVATE KEY-----\n...\n-----END PRIVATE KEY-----\n"
# MP4 video darslar saqlanadigan joy (Firebase Console → Storage). Bo'sh = standart bucket.
# FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=linguaverse-81b52.firebasestorage.app

# ── ESKI funksiyalar (zaxira sifatida qoladi) ───────────────────────
GOOGLE_TTS_KEYS=AIza_kalit_1,AIza_kalit_2

# ── YOUTUBE VIDEO SEARCH (YouTube Data API v3) ───────────────────────
# Jonli, o‘quvchining eng zaif ko‘nikmasiga mos video kartalari uchun.
# Kalit: Google Cloud Console → YouTube Data API v3 → API key.
# Kalitni YouTube Data API v3 bilan cheklang; admin panelda ham kiritish mumkin.
YOUTUBE_API_KEY=youtube_data_api_kaliti


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# SOZLAGANDAN KEYIN TEKSHIRING (brauzerda oching):
#   /.netlify/functions/ai                     → provayderlar tayyormi
#   /.netlify/functions/azure-speech?test=1    → TTS va token ishlaydimi
#   /.netlify/functions/payment                → inpay sozlamalari
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Bepul video rejimi ──
# Cloudflare R2 (10 GB bepul, ko'rish trafigi bepul) — MP4 darslar shu yerda
R2_ACCOUNT_ID=
R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
R2_BUCKET=linguaverse-videos
# Oylik ovoz limiti (Azure bepul F0 = 500 000). 0 = cheklovsiz (pullik tarif)
TTS_MONTHLY_CHARS=450000
# Darslar ovozi: azure (standart, bepul limit) yoki elevenlabs
LESSON_VOICE=azure
# Dars davomiyligi (daqiqa)
LESSON_MINUTES=30
# Avto-video: o'quvchi darsni ochishi bilan shu darsning MP4 i GitHub'da yasaladi.
# Kerak: GITHUB_TOKEN (fine-grained, faqat shu repo, "Actions: Read and write") va GITHUB_REPO=login/repo
AUTO_VIDEO=on
